    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR adds WARL (Write Any Read Legal) normative rules for CSR fields that are only declared in wavedrom register layouts and ensures missing entries have the `impl-def-behavior = true` property set. The changes primarily affect hypervisor, RNMI, and supervisor extension YAML files and their corresponding JSON norm tags.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Added 9 new WARL implementation-defined behavior rules for CSR fields in the hypervisor extension\n- Converted 3 existing rules to uppercase WARL format with impl-def-behavior flags in the RNMI extension\n- Reorganized and expanded supervisor interrupt rules with specific uppercase WARL rules\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 8 out of 9 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| src/supervisor.adoc | Added anchor for stvec image and updated inline markup for sip/sie normative rule references |\r\n| src/rnmi.adoc | Added image anchors for mncause and mnstatus register layouts |\r\n| src/hypervisor.adoc | Replaced old anchor references with norm-prefixed anchors for register layout images |\r\n| ref/riscv-unprivileged-norm-tags.json | Formatting changes removing empty arrays and adding cache_block_size norm tag |\r\n| ref/riscv-privileged-norm-tags.json | Added new norm tags for image anchors and updated references throughout |\r\n| normative_rule_defs/supervisor.yaml | Split sip_sie_unimpl rule into 8 specific rules and added WARL rules for stvec, sip, and sie |\r\n| normative_rule_defs/rnmi.yaml | Renamed mnepc_warl to MNEPC_WARL and added MNCAUSE_WARL and MNSTATUS_WARL rules |\r\n| normative_rule_defs/hypervisor.yaml | Added WARL rules for hedeleg, hideleg, hvip, hip, hie, hgeie, vsip, vsie, and vstvec |\r\n| docs-resources | Updated subproject commit reference |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-isa-manual/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
